Artefact is a modified version of PdfCraft for Android
(https://github.com/artcraft-android/pdfcraft-android) by the ArtCraft Team, which is built on the
engine of PdfCraft (https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft) by storytold and the PdfCraft
contributors. Artefact changed the Android app (android/): its name, icon, signing and release
workflow, and its user interface, rewritten on Artefact's liquid glass design system, and added the
desk, notes, voice notes and Quick Preview. The engine crates (engine/crates, engine/vendor,
engine/mobile) come from PdfCraft, laid out under engine/. Artefact's changes are under the same
terms: MIT OR Apache-2.0, at your option.

Word documents: the engine of WordCraft (https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft) by storytold and
the WordCraft contributors, MIT OR Apache-2.0, pinned by commit (engine/Cargo.toml). Two of its
crates are vendored with Artefact's patches (engine/vendor/wordcraft-engine: no font store and so no
network code; engine/vendor/wordcraft-fonts: Android's font folders), keeping their licence files.
Its bundled faces Source Sans 3 and Source Serif 4 (Adobe, SIL Open Font License 1.1) are in
engine/assets/fonts with their licences.

Presentations: the slide reader and renderer of DeckCraft (https://github.com/storytold/deckcraft)
by storytold and the DeckCraft contributors, MIT OR Apache-2.0, pinned by commit; its fonts crate is
vendored with Artefact's Android patch (engine/vendor/deckcraft-fonts). Its last-resort face is
Ubuntu Light (Canonical Ltd. / Dalton Maag, Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0), from epaint_default_fonts.

Liquid glass: the backdrop library from AndroidLiquidGlass by Kyant0
(https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass), Apache-2.0, adapted. The velocity squash-and-stretch
of glass thumbs follows LiquidTracker from AndroidLiquidGlassView by Donny Yale
(https://github.com/QmDeve/AndroidLiquidGlassView), MIT, re-implemented for Compose.

Mascots: body outlines from bot-avatars by Jakub Antalik (Libraries.dev), MIT, drawn with an
expressive face rig in Compose (android/app/src/main/java/com/chethan616/clearpdf/ui/mascot).

Type: Plus Jakarta Sans (Copyright 2020 The Plus Jakarta Sans Project Authors), Doto (Copyright
2024 The Doto Project Authors) and DM Serif Display (Copyright 2014 Colophon Foundry), each under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (android/app/src/main/assets/licences/OFL-*.txt).

The original notice of PdfCraft for Android follows.

